WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.100 --> 00:02.550
[Disclaimer: Characters, behaviors, places, organizations, professions,

3
00:02.570 --> 00:05.030
and events shown in the series are entirely fictional,

4
00:05.050 --> 00:07.510
solely for the purpose of entertainment, with no intention to instruct

5
00:07.530 --> 00:09.990
or promote any kind of behavior; viewer discretion is advised]

6
00:13.710 --> 00:14.810
Xinxin!

7
00:16.710 --> 00:17.790
I'm sorry.

8
00:18.600 --> 00:19.600
One day,

9
00:19.960 --> 00:22.090
you'll find your own umbrella, Xinxin.

10
00:22.260 --> 00:24.520
No matter how hard it rains,

11
00:25.000 --> 00:26.610
you won't need to find shelter.

12
00:28.550 --> 00:29.500
Sweet dreams.

13
00:35.070 --> 00:36.070
Come with me.

14
00:36.510 --> 00:37.680
I'll buy it for you.

15
00:37.850 --> 00:40.100
Consider it a good-luck charm from a feng shui master.

16
00:41.190 --> 00:43.480
Will love ever find its way to me?

17
00:43.620 --> 00:44.560
It would.

18
00:44.580 --> 00:46.010
You won't even see it coming.

19
01:45.850 --> 01:46.610
Hey.

20
01:47.270 --> 01:48.320
Why are you spacing out?

21
01:49.490 --> 01:49.890
Huh?

22
01:50.220 --> 01:51.480
Are you thinking about what happened last night?

23
01:51.940 --> 01:53.610
I'm... I'm not.

24
01:55.040 --> 01:56.170
Come on, let's go inside

25
01:56.190 --> 01:57.200
and have breakfast.

26
01:58.330 --> 01:59.690
Oh? Let's go.

27
02:01.910 --> 02:03.200
Do you

28
02:03.830 --> 02:05.690
really eat like this every day?

29
02:10.270 --> 02:12.290
Have you ever heard of...

30
02:12.600 --> 02:13.600
Thai barbecue,

31
02:13.700 --> 02:14.770
pizza,

32
02:15.060 --> 02:17.040
or even cream cheese mochi?

33
02:18.500 --> 02:19.500
Of course I have.

34
02:19.820 --> 02:21.440
I just don't eat them.

35
02:24.330 --> 02:25.400
Afraid of gaining weight?

36
02:27.710 --> 02:28.710
I'm not.

37
02:29.050 --> 02:31.900
I just want to take care of my health

38
02:32.510 --> 02:34.810
because my mom only has me now.

39
02:35.420 --> 02:37.480
I want to take care of her for a long time.

40
02:38.910 --> 02:39.910
Whoa...

41
02:41.050 --> 02:42.070
You're making me

42
02:43.020 --> 02:44.300
feel guilty now.

43
02:46.810 --> 02:49.410
But you take good care of your mom too, don't you?

44
02:49.470 --> 02:51.910
And you don't have these every day.

45
02:52.510 --> 02:53.190
Am I right?

46
02:54.020 --> 02:55.690
Yeah, not every day.

47
02:56.500 --> 02:57.700
Who's gonna have these every day?

48
02:57.720 --> 02:59.800
Here, have some of my oranges.

49
03:01.090 --> 03:02.890
Try some. It’s easy to eat.

50
03:09.440 --> 03:11.010
This one’s easy to eat.

51
03:11.220 --> 03:12.220
It's tasty, too.

52
03:15.790 --> 03:17.990
Just don't think about it. Don't overthink it.

53
03:18.900 --> 03:21.120
The vibe of the house is...

54
03:21.290 --> 03:22.430
A little old-fashioned.

55
03:22.450 --> 03:24.580
No, I mean, it looks more luxurious.

56
03:30.310 --> 03:31.200
Hi.

57
03:32.460 --> 03:33.700
So pretty...

58
03:37.720 --> 03:39.290
What? Where are you going?

59
03:41.400 --> 03:42.590
Hello, Ms. Lada.

60
03:53.910 --> 03:55.510
Is there an emergency?

61
03:56.410 --> 03:57.190
There is.

62
03:58.500 --> 03:59.720
What is it?

63
04:00.010 --> 04:01.170
I wanted to see you.

64
04:02.500 --> 04:04.160
That's not an emergency.

65
04:04.730 --> 04:05.920
For me, it is.

66
04:06.220 --> 04:08.370
Or I wouldn't have come all the way here to see you.

67
04:11.120 --> 04:12.950
I'm totally speechless.

68
04:13.840 --> 04:15.300
Let's have dinner tonight.

69
04:15.800 --> 04:17.800
It's not work-related, so don't worry.

70
04:19.040 --> 04:20.580
If it's not work-related,

71
04:20.600 --> 04:22.170
that's even more worrying.

72
04:22.520 --> 04:23.610
Why is that?

73
04:24.330 --> 04:27.200
Is there something about me you don't trust?

74
04:27.550 --> 04:28.920
It's not like that.

75
04:29.220 --> 04:31.000
Well, I was just thinking...

76
04:31.020 --> 04:32.580
What else would we have to talk about

77
04:32.970 --> 04:35.120
if not work?

78
04:36.480 --> 04:37.480
Of course!

79
06:20.620 --> 06:21.770
Oyl!

80
06:21.790 --> 06:22.810
Oh, sis?

81
06:25.330 --> 06:27.180
If someone you've just met

82
06:27.490 --> 06:29.380
invites you out for a meal,

83
06:29.590 --> 06:31.010
do you think they're up to something?

84
06:33.790 --> 06:34.610
Definitely!

85
06:35.310 --> 06:36.570
What is it?

86
06:37.120 --> 06:38.400
It's either an investment opportunity

87
06:38.800 --> 06:40.440
or insurance they're trying to sell you.

88
06:41.510 --> 06:43.190
- What? - Be serious.

89
06:43.220 --> 06:45.600
How would I know?

90
06:45.960 --> 06:47.320
Why don't you ask them yourself?

91
06:47.970 --> 06:50.120
You sure ask a lot about other people's business.

92
06:53.530 --> 06:54.590
Hm...

93
06:55.730 --> 06:56.850
Anyway,

94
06:57.590 --> 06:59.490
we haven't heard from Soul, have we?

95
07:00.510 --> 07:01.660
I wonder how she's doing.

96
07:01.680 --> 07:02.520
See?

97
07:02.540 --> 07:04.600
I just said that, and you're asking again.

98
07:07.320 --> 07:08.210
I don't know.

99
07:08.230 --> 07:10.210
I guess they're fine, though.

100
07:10.230 --> 07:11.820
Otherwise, she would've called us

101
07:11.840 --> 07:13.310
to vent about it already.

102
07:14.200 --> 07:15.390
Yeah, you're right...

103
07:15.410 --> 07:16.030
Mm.

104
07:16.170 --> 07:17.790
Alright, let's get back to work.

105
07:18.900 --> 07:20.720
You shouldn't be the one saying that.

106
07:21.810 --> 07:23.100
You left me here alone.

107
07:27.180 --> 07:29.060
I agree with the feng shui master

108
07:29.080 --> 07:31.120
that we shouldn't start foundation piling yet.

109
07:31.540 --> 07:32.640
Could you say that again?

110
07:32.900 --> 07:35.960
Actually, it's still unclear whether foundation piles are necessary.

111
07:36.070 --> 07:38.670
We need an engineer to conduct a soil investigation first.

112
07:38.690 --> 07:40.610
because it's a structural matter.

113
07:41.970 --> 07:45.000
I have to apologize to everyone...

114
07:45.200 --> 07:46.620
for lashing out yesterday as well.

115
07:48.610 --> 07:49.800
There's nothing to worry about.

116
07:49.820 --> 07:52.820
As long as you and the feng shui master

117
07:52.840 --> 07:54.890
understand each other well, I'm happy.

118
07:56.420 --> 07:56.990
Oh?

119
07:57.010 --> 07:59.510
I have to head back to Bangkok now

120
07:59.610 --> 08:01.090
because something urgent has come up.

121
08:01.110 --> 08:03.080
But don't worry,

122
08:03.100 --> 08:05.000
I've got dinner all taken care of.

123
08:05.250 --> 08:06.390
You shouldn't miss it.

124
08:06.410 --> 08:07.890
If you need anything, feel free to contact my secretary.

125
08:07.910 --> 08:08.730
Thank you.

126
08:08.750 --> 08:09.790
My pleasure.

127
08:10.200 --> 08:12.190
You can use Madam's name

128
08:12.210 --> 08:13.600
for the 6:00 P.M. reservation.

129
08:13.700 --> 08:15.510
- Thank you, Madam. - Thank you.

130
08:15.530 --> 08:17.290
I hope you both enjoy dinner tonight.

131
08:17.310 --> 08:18.390
I'll get going now.

132
08:18.410 --> 08:19.110
Of course.

133
08:19.130 --> 08:20.110
Okay.

134
08:20.610 --> 08:21.770
- Goodbye. - Goodbye.

135
08:21.790 --> 08:23.090
Goodbye.

136
08:30.690 --> 08:31.990
Want to go for a walk?

137
08:37.970 --> 08:40.210
And why did you suddenly believe me?

138
08:41.320 --> 08:42.190
No.

139
08:42.400 --> 08:43.960
I didn't believe you.

140
08:44.710 --> 08:47.710
I talked to a senior of mine who's an engineer.

141
08:49.110 --> 08:51.320
Did they say we shouldn't do the piling?

142
08:52.630 --> 08:53.510
No.

143
08:53.530 --> 08:56.030
They said this is an engineer's job.

144
08:56.050 --> 08:57.290
I should stay out of it.

145
08:57.310 --> 08:58.820
They'll handle the structural work themselves.

146
08:59.540 --> 09:00.310
Really?

147
09:01.720 --> 09:03.190
He chewed me out for that.

148
09:04.600 --> 09:07.320
How did you know piling wasn't necessary?

149
09:08.830 --> 09:10.100
Well...

150
09:20.210 --> 09:21.900
the topsoil there isn't quite shallow.

151
09:23.100 --> 09:24.710
You know about this stuff, too?

152
09:25.840 --> 09:27.690
A feng shui master should know some of this, too.

153
09:27.710 --> 09:28.710
Whoa...

154
09:29.100 --> 09:31.770
I'm an architect, but even I don't know this much.

155
09:32.030 --> 09:33.310
That's alright.

156
09:33.340 --> 09:34.830
You're an architect, Soul,

157
09:34.850 --> 09:36.070
not an engineer.

158
09:36.090 --> 09:37.290
It's alright if you don't know.

159
09:40.700 --> 09:41.410
Uh...

160
09:41.600 --> 09:42.810
what are you smiling about?

161
09:44.010 --> 09:45.180
Can you call me that again?

162
09:46.300 --> 09:47.440
Call you what?

163
09:48.510 --> 09:49.810
You called me "Soul."

164
09:55.610 --> 09:57.810
Where are you going, Xinxin? Wait for me!

165
09:58.500 --> 09:59.210
Xinxin!

166
09:59.490 --> 10:00.730
Come on, wait for me.

167
10:02.880 --> 10:03.920
What?

168
10:04.120 --> 10:05.290
Why are you pulling me?

169
10:07.290 --> 10:09.020
Let's have dinner together tonight, okay?

170
10:13.920 --> 10:14.590
Mm.

171
10:15.490 --> 10:17.590
Madam Waen already booked us a table.

172
10:20.850 --> 10:22.300
Come on, let's go back.

173
10:31.190 --> 10:32.190
I'm sorry.

174
10:34.510 --> 10:36.300
Just hold my hand properly.

175
10:36.320 --> 10:37.590
You don't have to pull me.

176
11:21.200 --> 11:23.700
Am I late, or are you just early?

177
11:24.730 --> 11:26.000
I got here early

178
11:26.540 --> 11:28.400
because I wanted to see you sooner.

179
11:33.180 --> 11:34.000
Wine?

180
11:35.330 --> 11:36.120
Sure.

181
11:56.320 --> 11:57.530
What made you

182
11:57.610 --> 11:59.210
ask me out to dinner?

183
12:00.700 --> 12:02.600
I wanted to get to know you better,

184
12:03.140 --> 12:05.230
but not as your client.

185
12:06.910 --> 12:07.580
Why?

186
12:08.790 --> 12:10.300
You really don't realize

187
12:11.450 --> 12:12.810
I'm into you?

188
12:15.230 --> 12:16.400
I know.

189
12:17.000 --> 12:18.320
You're so obvious.

190
12:20.220 --> 12:21.610
You are, too.

191
12:22.310 --> 12:23.640
Otherwise, you wouldn't be here with me.

192
12:27.090 --> 12:28.300
Aren't you put off by me?

193
12:30.520 --> 12:32.300
You're not off-putting at all.

194
12:33.140 --> 12:34.300
Besides,

195
12:34.590 --> 12:36.880
I've had my eye on you

196
12:37.010 --> 12:38.500
ever since we first met.

197
12:44.340 --> 12:45.290
What about you?

198
12:46.500 --> 12:47.880
Are you really into me,

199
12:47.900 --> 12:49.710
or are you just interested?

200
12:52.450 --> 12:55.380
Well, I don't know if I like you or not,

201
12:56.110 --> 12:57.910
but I'm very interested.

202
13:03.700 --> 13:05.290
I'm dying to know

203
13:05.500 --> 13:07.800
if I can make you like me.

204
14:16.400 --> 14:17.530
Did you come looking for me?

205
14:21.360 --> 14:22.360
Mm.

206
14:22.380 --> 14:24.690
I couldn't find you when I came out of the bathroom.

207
14:26.190 --> 14:26.800
Well...

208
14:27.000 --> 14:28.580
you took a long shower,

209
14:28.600 --> 14:30.110
so I went out for a walk.

210
14:31.730 --> 14:33.320
Why are you wearing your hair down today?

211
14:35.630 --> 14:36.290
Well...

212
14:36.740 --> 14:37.900
it goes well with my outfit today.

213
14:40.800 --> 14:41.980
It really suits your outfit.

214
14:44.300 --> 14:45.370
What did you just say?

215
14:48.060 --> 14:48.900
No.

216
14:49.340 --> 14:50.340
Nothing.

217
14:51.550 --> 14:53.210
I heard you say something.

218
14:53.590 --> 14:55.030
I bet you said

219
14:55.050 --> 14:57.610
it doesn't suit me, or that I look ugly in it.

220
15:00.810 --> 15:01.810
You look pretty...

221
15:15.410 --> 15:16.700
I'm hungry.

222
15:16.820 --> 15:17.890
Let's go grab something.

223
15:20.600 --> 15:21.400
"Pretty..."

224
15:28.390 --> 15:29.390
You...

225
15:29.790 --> 15:31.000
can eat these, right?

226
15:31.800 --> 15:33.490
There aren't any veggies in them.

227
15:34.270 --> 15:35.390
It's just one day.

228
15:35.410 --> 15:37.730
Since we're at the beach, we might as well have some seafood.

229
15:41.030 --> 15:41.990
But...

230
15:42.530 --> 15:43.810
I'm a bit bummed.

231
15:44.100 --> 15:46.110
I thought they were gonna peel the shrimp

232
15:46.130 --> 15:47.630
and crack the crabs for me.

233
15:48.690 --> 15:50.510
The best part about eating seafood

234
15:50.530 --> 15:52.630
is getting to do it yourself, you know.

235
15:54.220 --> 15:55.710
I can't be bothered.

236
15:56.290 --> 15:56.840
Oh.

237
15:57.500 --> 15:58.920
I forgot to wash my hands.

238
15:59.150 --> 16:00.600
I just got done playing in the sand.

239
16:01.290 --> 16:02.490
Hold on, I'm gonna wash them.

240
16:19.590 --> 16:20.280
Wait...

241
16:20.570 --> 16:21.910
did you peel them for me?

242
16:24.090 --> 16:25.200
I didn't.

243
16:25.510 --> 16:27.100
I just asked the staff.

244
16:27.580 --> 16:29.420
Oh...

245
16:39.940 --> 16:41.030
What's the matter?

246
16:41.290 --> 16:42.560
Are you allergic to seafood?

247
16:42.700 --> 16:44.710
No, I'm not.

248
16:44.880 --> 16:45.880
Um...

249
16:46.300 --> 16:48.650
I think it's the sea breeze.

250
16:48.910 --> 16:51.300
It gets colder as the sun starts to set.

251
16:52.420 --> 16:53.200
Whoa.

252
16:53.850 --> 16:55.400
That shrimp is huge.

253
16:55.420 --> 16:57.800
What if you get sick?

254
16:59.320 --> 17:00.610
I rarely get sick.

255
17:00.830 --> 17:02.720
You're the one who should be careful.

256
17:16.930 --> 17:17.630
What?

257
17:18.730 --> 17:22.210
You peeled them for me until your hands were bleeding.

258
17:24.210 --> 17:25.210
Put your spoon down!

259
17:25.650 --> 17:26.330
Come on.

260
17:28.990 --> 17:31.810
You can just admit you did it, you know.

261
17:31.830 --> 17:33.800
It won't kill you to admit it.

262
17:35.000 --> 17:37.490
You'll get too comfortable and start making me do everything.

263
17:39.500 --> 17:41.210
I'm not that bad.

264
17:41.510 --> 17:42.800
You are that bad.

265
18:00.810 --> 18:01.990
Done.

266
18:06.810 --> 18:07.810
Thank you.

267
18:14.130 --> 18:15.200
Let's dig in.

268
18:16.310 --> 18:17.480
Let me dip mine, too.

269
18:23.550 --> 18:24.600
This is so good!

270
18:26.520 --> 18:28.280
All for you. Finish them all, okay?

271
18:28.300 --> 18:29.300
Can I?

272
18:37.500 --> 18:39.210
I'm so full!

273
18:39.740 --> 18:40.980
Are you okay?

274
18:41.610 --> 18:42.920
Or do I have to carry you?

275
18:43.990 --> 18:45.110
Can you?

276
18:46.690 --> 18:48.250
My back's gonna break for sure.

277
18:49.220 --> 18:51.500
I'm not that heavy.

278
18:53.460 --> 18:54.970
So...

279
18:54.990 --> 18:56.560
what are you gonna do when we get back?

280
18:56.590 --> 18:57.590
Go straight to bed?

281
18:58.320 --> 19:00.120
I'll probably do some work first.

282
19:01.250 --> 19:02.960
You still have to do it?

283
19:03.310 --> 19:05.300
I'm most productive at night,

284
19:05.790 --> 19:07.130
but I don't usually stay up late.

285
19:07.150 --> 19:08.510
I'm not really a fan of it.

286
19:10.010 --> 19:12.000
You're taking such good care of yourself.

287
19:12.020 --> 19:13.820
How could Auntie Tai still be worried about you?

288
19:14.250 --> 19:15.940
My mom is just like that.

289
19:16.250 --> 19:18.390
I'm all she has left now,

290
19:19.320 --> 19:22.910
since my dad passed away after working so hard for our family.

291
19:23.610 --> 19:26.220
So my mom doesn't want me to end up like him.

292
19:27.510 --> 19:28.620
That's why...

293
19:29.570 --> 19:31.990
you're taking good care of yourself for her, right?

294
19:34.890 --> 19:36.420
For now, yes.

295
19:37.780 --> 19:40.680
But someday, I might meet someone...

296
19:41.700 --> 19:44.490
who makes me want to live a long life with them.

297
19:47.700 --> 19:49.480
You used to tell me...

298
19:49.780 --> 19:52.800
love will find its way to me before I even realize it, right?

299
19:54.740 --> 19:55.620
Mm.

300
19:56.710 --> 19:57.820
Yeah.

301
19:59.530 --> 20:00.810
I think...

302
20:01.160 --> 20:02.410
it's getting closer.

303
20:23.500 --> 20:27.020
You're the first person I've ever brought to my place, you know.

304
20:28.230 --> 20:29.700
Should I feel honored?

305
20:30.500 --> 20:32.600
What? You should!

306
20:33.010 --> 20:35.280
since you're my first.

307
20:36.110 --> 20:38.030
You're my first, too.

308
20:39.800 --> 20:42.010
But I've never been to your place, though.

309
20:43.710 --> 20:45.200
I mean...

310
20:45.590 --> 20:48.180
you're the first woman I've ever liked.

311
20:54.920 --> 20:55.920
Come on.

312
20:58.510 --> 21:00.150
- Hey... - Hey, where's your key?

313
21:07.500 --> 21:08.300
What are you doing?

314
21:09.400 --> 21:11.900
Nothing. I was just checking my work.

315
21:13.000 --> 21:14.510
Then why are you hiding it?

316
21:15.210 --> 21:17.280
I think I caught a glimpse of it.

317
21:17.420 --> 21:20.550
It's the same color as the shirt I wore today.

318
21:20.730 --> 21:21.660
Nothing, Xinxin.

319
21:21.670 --> 21:23.690
I told you it's just some work.

320
21:25.220 --> 21:26.290
Really?

321
21:26.840 --> 21:27.790
Mm.

322
21:29.410 --> 21:30.410
Okay.

323
21:33.660 --> 21:34.400
Let me see it.

324
21:34.920 --> 21:37.290
No, it's just my work.

325
21:37.310 --> 21:38.710
- I really saw it. - My work...

326
21:38.910 --> 21:40.800
I told you it's work. It's not... Hey...

327
21:41.610 --> 21:42.520
Hey!

328
22:01.410 --> 22:02.590
- Ow! - You pervert!

329
22:06.200 --> 22:07.070
What, Xinxin?

330
22:07.080 --> 22:08.920
I haven't even done anything.

331
22:10.000 --> 22:12.610
So does that mean you'll do it if I get carried away?

332
22:14.520 --> 22:15.310
What?

333
22:16.010 --> 22:17.960
That means you might get carried away?

334
22:18.480 --> 22:19.320
- Hey! - Ow!

335
22:19.400 --> 22:21.900
It hurts. Why did you hit me, Xinxin?

336
22:22.840 --> 22:23.840
Good.

337
22:23.860 --> 22:24.800
Maybe now you'll remember!

338
22:25.010 --> 22:25.790
Ow...

339
22:55.400 --> 22:56.400
Xinxin.

340
23:00.260 --> 23:01.280
Xinxin...

341
23:01.710 --> 23:04.110
What? I'm gonna sleep.

342
23:05.740 --> 23:06.790
Sweet dreams.

343
23:55.420 --> 23:57.800
Hey, are you secretly taking pictures of me?

344
23:59.810 --> 24:00.600
Mm.

345
24:01.900 --> 24:03.410
Let me see. Do I look pretty?

346
24:06.810 --> 24:07.810
Yeah.

347
24:09.600 --> 24:10.200
Whoa!

348
24:10.700 --> 24:12.000
You took really nice pictures.

349
24:12.020 --> 24:13.100
Can you send them to me?

350
24:15.510 --> 24:17.100
You're even prettier in person than in the photo.

351
24:25.040 --> 24:25.690
It's...

352
24:25.910 --> 24:27.100
It's getting too hot now.

353
24:27.490 --> 24:28.290
We should get going.

354
25:09.190 --> 25:09.810
Oh!

355
25:10.390 --> 25:12.330
This is my favorite song.

356
25:13.010 --> 25:18.090
♫Because I feel too much for you♫

357
25:18.610 --> 25:25.360
♫With all my heart, but I know it's impossible♫

358
25:25.380 --> 25:28.040
Lada, wanna sing? It's so much fun.

359
25:28.060 --> 25:29.060
Oh, this song!

360
25:29.080 --> 25:31.410
This is also my favorite, Ms. Lada!

361
25:31.630 --> 25:32.900
If you don't mind.

362
25:34.200 --> 25:38.320
♫The Siam tulips bloom, but soon they will wither♫

363
25:38.340 --> 25:40.710
♫I'm still waiting just the same,♫

364
25:40.720 --> 25:44.440
♫Whose woman have you become?♫

365
25:47.160 --> 25:52.380
♫The Siam tulips bloom, but soon they will wither♫

366
26:50.210 --> 26:51.310
Same clothes.

367
27:22.620 --> 27:23.310
Hey.

368
27:24.300 --> 27:25.300
Are you up already?

369
27:26.490 --> 27:28.690
There's nothing in your fridge, Mim.

370
27:29.710 --> 27:30.910
How about a fried egg?

371
27:32.620 --> 27:33.620
"Mim..."

372
27:34.800 --> 27:36.000
Do you even remember anything?

373
27:39.800 --> 27:41.400
Gosh. Hey, you...

374
27:41.500 --> 27:42.790
- Don't go limp on me. - I'm sleepy...

375
27:42.810 --> 27:43.920
You have to help me, too.

376
27:44.110 --> 27:44.810
Ouch...

377
27:46.600 --> 27:49.180
What’s with all that “you and I”?

378
27:49.500 --> 27:50.810
Well, just "You and I."

379
27:50.820 --> 27:52.590
I'm tired of "Ms." this and that.

380
27:54.390 --> 27:57.200
Oh...

381
28:04.200 --> 28:05.490
Lada...

382
28:07.190 --> 28:09.610
Do you really like me...

383
28:09.960 --> 28:12.200
or are you just messing with me?

384
28:21.710 --> 28:23.120
Well...

385
28:24.400 --> 28:25.600
It's...

386
28:27.390 --> 28:28.120
Um...

387
28:52.300 --> 28:54.100
I didn't answer you last night

388
28:54.620 --> 28:55.680
because you were too drunk.

389
28:58.500 --> 28:59.990
As for whether

390
29:00.010 --> 29:03.400
I really like you or I'm just messing around...

391
29:05.220 --> 29:06.120
It's fun.

392
29:10.200 --> 29:11.960
It's fun being with you.

393
29:17.990 --> 29:19.500
So, I think...

394
29:22.200 --> 29:24.620
I actually might really like you, Mim.

395
30:01.920 --> 30:04.020
Thank you for dropping me off.

396
30:05.900 --> 30:08.500
Aren’t you even going to invite me in?

397
30:09.550 --> 30:10.600
Nope.

398
30:11.110 --> 30:12.300
My mom isn't home yet.

399
30:12.490 --> 30:14.380
I'm afraid I won't be safe.

400
30:15.410 --> 30:16.310
Xinxin.

401
30:16.510 --> 30:17.910
If you keep saying things like this,

402
30:17.930 --> 30:20.360
I'll start thinking you're actually scared of me.

403
30:20.520 --> 30:22.890
It's not like that. I'm not scared of you.

404
30:22.910 --> 30:24.310
I was just joking.

405
30:25.610 --> 30:26.520
Okay.

406
30:26.700 --> 30:28.400
At least I know...

407
30:29.140 --> 30:30.400
you care about me.

408
30:32.100 --> 30:33.100
See you later.

409
30:34.400 --> 30:36.360
There's no reason for us to meet again.

410
30:37.910 --> 30:38.820
Oh,

411
30:39.160 --> 30:40.410
there are plenty of reasons.

412
30:42.400 --> 30:43.200
I'll head inside now.

413
30:43.820 --> 30:44.560
Bye-bye.

414
30:47.520 --> 30:48.520
Well,

415
30:49.000 --> 30:50.100
and...

416
30:51.350 --> 30:52.580
don't stay up late.

417
30:54.290 --> 30:55.680
Or Auntie Tai will be worried about you.

418
30:59.200 --> 31:00.480
Come on, let me help.

419
31:03.930 --> 31:04.920
I'll close it for you.

420
31:04.940 --> 31:06.000
Go on inside.

421
31:36.300 --> 31:37.910
Gosh, Soul, are you smiling?

422
31:57.250 --> 32:01.180
[Xinxin]

423
32:04.160 --> 32:05.180
Hm...

424
32:05.600 --> 32:08.100
You took so many pictures of me, Miss Architect.

425
32:09.350 --> 32:10.800
Since you took so many,

426
32:10.820 --> 32:12.810
I guess I should charge you, huh?

427
32:14.040 --> 32:15.770
Shouldn't you be thanking me

428
32:15.790 --> 32:17.900
for the photos you can post on Instagram?

429
32:18.340 --> 32:21.570
Oh, thank you.

430
32:24.700 --> 32:26.180
Sweet dreams, Xinxin.

431
32:29.560 --> 32:30.590
Not yet.

432
32:50.110 --> 32:51.110
[New post]

433
32:51.130 --> 32:52.600
She took some pretty cute pictures, huh?

434
33:01.610 --> 33:02.370
[Share]

435
33:19.760 --> 33:21.640
[JR CONSTRUCTION]

436
33:31.610 --> 33:32.280
Weird.

437
33:32.630 --> 33:33.590
So weird.

438
33:34.090 --> 33:35.010
True.

439
33:35.200 --> 33:37.100
She's usually as expressionless as a robot.

440
33:37.720 --> 33:39.200
The moment she got back from Prachuap Khiri Khan,

441
33:40.500 --> 33:41.580
she started smiling.

442
33:43.300 --> 33:44.900
Come on, what are we waiting for?

443
33:44.920 --> 33:45.910
Let's go.

444
33:48.590 --> 33:49.700
- Soul! - Soul!

445
33:50.450 --> 33:51.280
Gosh...

446
33:51.360 --> 33:52.650
You scared the heck out of me.

447
33:52.670 --> 33:54.120
Popping up out of nowhere like ghosts.

448
33:54.410 --> 33:55.600
Wow...

449
33:56.510 --> 33:58.930
Was there something good at Pran Buri or what?

450
33:58.950 --> 34:00.310
- Yeah. - Exactly.

451
34:00.700 --> 34:01.520
Why do you ask?

452
34:01.810 --> 34:02.620
Well,

453
34:02.640 --> 34:05.150
you walked into our office with this creepy smile.

454
34:05.170 --> 34:07.390
- Yeah. - Plus, you're wearing your lucky color.

455
34:07.410 --> 34:08.760
- That's right. - Yeah.

456
34:09.920 --> 34:11.210
Is it that obvious?

457
34:11.500 --> 34:12.790
Yeah!

458
34:12.920 --> 34:15.530
Since when did you start believing in this stuff?

459
34:15.550 --> 34:17.110
I thought you said it was nonsense.

460
34:17.890 --> 34:19.490
It doesn't hurt to believe a little, does it?

461
34:19.510 --> 34:21.280
I've got a client meeting today,

462
34:22.130 --> 34:23.550
so it's nice to have something to believe in.

463
34:23.570 --> 34:24.460
Oh...

464
34:24.480 --> 34:25.980
Really?

465
34:27.110 --> 34:29.190
You're acting suspicious, huh?

466
34:29.320 --> 34:31.960
Stop teasing me and get the work ready for the client.

467
34:32.110 --> 34:33.700
If you two keep teasing me,

468
34:33.720 --> 34:35.350
I'll rat you out to the boss

469
34:35.370 --> 34:36.720
and tell him you've got nothing better to do.

470
34:36.750 --> 34:37.400
Hey!

471
34:37.820 --> 34:40.590
Alright, you can take it from here, Mim.

472
34:40.610 --> 34:44.310
- I'd better...get back to work. - Hey.

473
34:44.340 --> 34:45.580
Hey, I'm...

474
34:45.600 --> 34:46.770
I'm busy now.

475
34:46.790 --> 34:48.450
- I'm off. Bye-bye. - Hey, Mim... Mim!

476
34:48.470 --> 34:50.270
Mim! Your card!

477
34:50.290 --> 34:52.080
- Mim. I'm out. - Hey!

478
35:21.700 --> 35:22.790
Hello, Xinxin.

479
35:23.560 --> 35:24.590
Miss Architect.

480
35:26.190 --> 35:29.000
I'm waiting to meet a client. I'll be done in half an hour.

481
35:29.490 --> 35:30.710
Is something up, Xinxin?

482
35:30.870 --> 35:33.500
Well... never mind. That’s all.

483
35:35.190 --> 35:36.110
Hold on!

484
35:36.230 --> 35:37.110
Xinxin!

485
35:43.500 --> 35:45.510
What's the matter, Xinxin?

486
35:51.890 --> 35:54.260
Something urgent came up. Can you handle the client for me?!

487
35:54.280 --> 35:55.700
I'll talk to the boss about this later.

488
35:56.030 --> 35:57.580
Hey, Soul!

489
35:57.600 --> 35:58.600
Wait!

490
36:01.180 --> 36:01.880
Uh...

491
36:30.390 --> 36:33.400
Could you move back a little bit?

492
36:33.610 --> 36:34.880
I'm a little uncomfortable.

493
36:36.400 --> 36:39.920
Sorry, my eyesight isn't that great,

494
36:39.940 --> 36:41.560
so I have to look at things up close.

495
36:42.700 --> 36:43.580
Oh...

496
36:43.900 --> 36:44.590
Well...

497
36:45.420 --> 36:47.830
I'll show it to you once it's done.

498
36:49.300 --> 36:50.090
Alright.

499
37:06.000 --> 37:07.600
How about this?

500
37:07.800 --> 37:09.690
Once we're done with work,

501
37:09.900 --> 37:11.240
why don't we go out to eat together?

502
37:11.630 --> 37:14.710
Just think of it as a little celebration for working together.

503
37:15.200 --> 37:16.820
I'm afraid I can't.

504
37:19.010 --> 37:20.010
It won't take long.

505
37:22.790 --> 37:23.890
I don't think she can.

506
37:27.790 --> 37:28.790
Who are you?

507
37:29.390 --> 37:30.490
How did you get into my house?!

508
37:31.510 --> 37:33.410
I'm Feng Shui Master Xinxin's girlfriend.

509
37:47.300 --> 37:48.410
Even matching outfits, huh?

510
37:53.200 --> 37:55.200
I didn't think the timing would be this perfect.

511
38:00.890 --> 38:02.300
You can let go of me now.

512
38:04.410 --> 38:06.490
Why did you say that to him?

513
38:07.210 --> 38:08.290
Say what?

514
38:09.720 --> 38:11.000
Well...

515
38:12.190 --> 38:13.350
Telling him

516
38:13.370 --> 38:14.780
that I'm your girlfriend?

517
38:15.750 --> 38:16.810
Mm.

518
38:17.950 --> 38:19.590
Would he have let you go

519
38:19.790 --> 38:21.510
if I hadn't said that to his face?

520
38:22.000 --> 38:24.910
You can tell just by looking at his face that he's not trustworthy.

521
38:31.290 --> 38:33.980
Thank you...for coming.

522
38:39.420 --> 38:40.420
Hey.

523
38:40.730 --> 38:42.080
What about your work?

524
38:42.300 --> 38:44.200
You said you have a client meeting today.

525
38:45.390 --> 38:46.510
Don't worry.

526
38:46.900 --> 38:48.610
You're more important, Xinxin.

527
38:54.610 --> 38:57.100
I'm sorry for causing you trouble.

528
38:58.230 --> 38:59.920
I told you it's okay.

529
38:59.940 --> 39:01.320
Don't worry about it.

530
39:02.840 --> 39:04.960
But if you feel bad,

531
39:06.490 --> 39:08.690
why don't you treat me to a meal?

532
39:12.690 --> 39:13.380
Mm.

533
39:16.930 --> 39:17.930
Mm...

534
39:18.900 --> 39:20.010
You promise?

535
39:33.740 --> 39:36.330
Hello. A table for two?

536
39:36.590 --> 39:37.380
Yes.

537
39:37.510 --> 39:39.290
Um... excuse me...

538
39:39.310 --> 39:41.430
you two are a couple, right?

539
39:41.690 --> 39:43.100
No, we're not!

540
39:44.840 --> 39:47.910
Oh, I saw you wearing matching outfits, so I assumed you were.

541
39:48.000 --> 39:49.430
My apologies.

542
39:49.550 --> 39:52.200
Today is the owner's wedding anniversary,

543
39:52.220 --> 39:54.020
so we're offering a special 20% discount on food

544
39:54.040 --> 39:55.760
for all couples.

545
39:55.780 --> 39:57.020
We are.

546
39:57.040 --> 39:59.490
Well...we had a little spat,

547
39:59.510 --> 40:01.720
but we're actually dating.

548
40:04.010 --> 40:07.110
Oh, alright. Right this way, please.

549
40:10.810 --> 40:11.810
What are you doing?

550
40:15.220 --> 40:16.010
What?

551
40:16.190 --> 40:19.290
You told my client we were a couple earlier,

552
40:19.310 --> 40:20.400
so I'm just doing the same.

553
40:20.490 --> 40:22.580
They’re even offering 20% off.

554
40:22.600 --> 40:23.670
Who wouldn't want that?

555
40:25.700 --> 40:26.890
I'm blushing here.

556
40:29.190 --> 40:29.690
Come on.

557
40:30.040 --> 40:31.040
Gosh!

558
40:47.610 --> 40:49.620
Why are you wearing your hair down again today?

559
40:50.310 --> 40:52.000
Don't tell me...

560
40:52.020 --> 40:53.400
it goes with this outfit, too.

561
40:55.290 --> 40:57.290
It really does match, though.

562
40:58.520 --> 40:59.520
Oh, really?

563
40:59.610 --> 41:01.490
I thought you let your hair down

564
41:01.610 --> 41:02.670
because I said

565
41:02.700 --> 41:04.910
you looked pretty with it down the other day.

566
41:13.120 --> 41:14.420
It's not like that.

567
41:14.910 --> 41:16.690
I look pretty no matter how I wear my hair.

568
41:20.320 --> 41:21.320
That's true.

569
41:39.120 --> 41:40.960
How did you know about this restaurant?

570
41:41.120 --> 41:43.190
I bet you bring girls here on dates all the time.

571
41:43.590 --> 41:45.080
There's nothing but couples.

572
41:46.190 --> 41:48.200
Why would I bring girls here all the time?

573
41:49.270 --> 41:50.010
Well...

574
41:50.290 --> 41:51.930
this place looks so romantic.

575
41:51.950 --> 41:53.030
It's perfect for a date.

576
41:55.710 --> 41:56.710
In that case...

577
41:58.010 --> 42:00.110
I guess you're the first woman

578
42:00.300 --> 42:02.000
I've ever brought here on a date.

579
42:16.350 --> 42:18.490
You don't have to do this for me.

580
42:18.510 --> 42:20.210
I won't tell Auntie Tai.

581
42:20.940 --> 42:22.210
What I'm doing

582
42:22.710 --> 42:24.190
is because I want to do it for you.

583
42:24.810 --> 42:26.690
Not because anyone told me to.

584
42:29.210 --> 42:30.210
Well...

585
42:30.610 --> 42:32.300
you must be quite the flirt, then.

586
42:33.120 --> 42:33.890
Hm?

587
42:35.240 --> 42:36.040
Well...

588
42:36.300 --> 42:38.270
you look after me, take care of me, pay attention to me,

589
42:38.390 --> 42:40.180
and sometimes you even spoil me.

590
42:40.200 --> 42:42.000
That's what you'd call flirting.

591
42:44.600 --> 42:46.010
So, can I?

592
43:04.200 --> 43:05.720
You can call me anytime.

593
43:08.120 --> 43:08.960
Hm?

594
43:09.230 --> 43:11.390
If you ever run into something you're not okay with

595
43:11.730 --> 43:13.300
and don't know who to call,

596
43:14.010 --> 43:15.800
you can always call me.

597
43:16.620 --> 43:18.680
You can even use my name and say I'm your girlfriend.

598
43:23.190 --> 43:24.640
You, too.

599
43:25.160 --> 43:25.880
Hm?

600
43:26.830 --> 43:28.820
You can use my name, too.

601
43:29.000 --> 43:31.900
Just in case you get caught dating around or something,

602
43:31.920 --> 43:34.710
you can use my name as an excuse.

603
43:36.140 --> 43:38.070
Hm... I don't think

604
43:38.420 --> 43:40.230
I'd ever need to use your name.

605
43:42.360 --> 43:44.360
Because lately,

606
43:45.210 --> 43:46.590
you're the only one in my life.

607
43:48.400 --> 43:50.090
So there's no need to use your name.

608
44:21.320 --> 44:23.770
So Soul is your architect?

609
44:23.800 --> 44:26.160
Let's talk about these two.

610
44:26.180 --> 44:27.770
Hey, how could you not tell me?!

611
44:27.790 --> 44:28.480
I'm shocked!

612
44:29.120 --> 44:31.100
Are you really sick?

613
44:31.120 --> 44:32.660
Why don't we share a bed every night?

614
44:32.690 --> 44:33.480
What?

615
44:33.720 --> 44:35.780
Where do we go from here?

616
44:38.230 --> 44:39.760
When we really like someone,

617
44:40.690 --> 44:42.400
what does it feel like?

618
44:43.410 --> 44:46.290
Try placing your hand on your heart, like this.

619
44:52.890 --> 44:54.390
You're calling so early. What's up?

620
44:55.000 --> 44:57.490
What's today's lucky color?

621
44:57.730 --> 44:59.910
There's plenty of information online, isn't there?

622
45:00.100 --> 45:02.910
I wanted to ask an expert to make sure I got it right.

623
45:06.400 --> 45:09.690
Light blue and dark blue for career success.

624
45:09.710 --> 45:11.790
Just don't wear black or gray.

625
45:12.540 --> 45:13.590
That will bring bad luck.

626
45:20.900 --> 45:22.300
Alright.

627
45:22.330 --> 45:25.190
Understood, Miss Feng Shui.
